<title>UK: Enterprise gains after oil discovery.</title>
<headline>Enterprise gains after oil discovery.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Enterprise Oil Plc rose in early trade on Tuesday after the group confirmed a crude oil discovery in the Gulf of Mexico.</p>
<p>The stock was up 6p at 639 by 0807 GMT.</p>
<p>Earlier a report in the Financial Times said the find, confirmed by Enterprise's partner Pennzoil could be significant because it was the first discovery made through the partnership since it was announced last December.</p>
<p>The paper said four blocks had been explored so far and a further 98 were to be investigated in the three-year deal.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
